<%# The same page whether or not the address has an account %>
<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Check your inbox</h1>
<p class="mt-2 text-base text-zinc-600">If an account exists for <span class="font-medium text-zinc-900"><%= values.email %></span>, we've sent a link to reset your password. The link expires in <%= limits.RESET_LINK_HOURS === 1 ? '1 hour' : `${limits.RESET_LINK_HOURS} hours` %>.</p>
<p class="mt-3 text-base text-zinc-600">If you don't receive an email within a few minutes, please check your spam folder and make sure you entered the address you signed up with.</p>
<a href="/app/login" class="btn-ghost mt-6 w-full justify-center border border-zinc-200 py-2.5 font-medium text-zinc-700">
  <iconify-icon icon="boxicons:arrow-left-stroke" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon>
  <span>Back to log in</span>
</a>
